1
00:00:53,679 --> 00:00:55,240
Sun Yao.

2
00:00:57,280 --> 00:00:59,359
You killed her.

3
00:01:01,679 --> 00:01:02,880
How could I bear to kill her?

4
00:01:03,240 --> 00:01:04,159
I liked her so much.

5
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:06,159
I could not love her enough.

6
00:01:07,159 --> 00:01:08,680
She flirted with me first.

7
00:01:32,920 --> 00:01:34,120
Why are you taking a picture of me?

8
00:01:34,480 --> 00:01:36,079
I'm so sorry.

9
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:38,959
I just thought your outfit looked nice.

10
00:01:38,959 --> 00:01:41,480
I wanted to send it to him for reference.

11
00:01:41,959 --> 00:01:44,239
If you mind, I'll delete it right away.

12
00:01:45,159 --> 00:01:48,319
It's okay. I appreciate the compliment.

13
00:01:49,040 --> 00:01:50,359
You're really nice, sir.

14
00:01:50,359 --> 00:01:51,120
Thank you.

15
00:02:03,959 --> 00:02:05,640
You're quite handsome.

16
00:02:05,719 --> 00:02:06,519
I do not get it.

17
00:02:06,840 --> 00:02:08,120
I am just an old man.

18
00:02:09,039 --> 00:02:09,960
Why take pictures of me

19
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:10,879
and send them to you?

20
00:02:12,520 --> 00:02:14,560
Does it mean I am more handsome than you?

21
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:17,960
You are jealous, right?

22
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:19,800
Feeling bitter, huh?

23
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:22,080
You're just scum!

24
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:23,360
Yes.

25
00:02:23,639 --> 00:02:24,960
I am scum.

26
00:02:25,159 --> 00:02:25,960
Let me tell you,

27
00:02:26,080 --> 00:02:28,719
that year we came up with a new scheme.

28
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:30,599
Which was

29
00:02:31,159 --> 00:02:32,159
to set up

30
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:35,520
someone by collecting their information.

31
00:02:36,360 --> 00:02:37,400
And then,

32
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:39,360
we would set up a scam targeting them.

33
00:02:39,919 --> 00:02:41,759
For example, telling that person

34
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:44,960
that we had caught their family member,

35
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:46,960
and kill the hostage if they did not pay.

36
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:48,039
You know what?

37
00:02:48,039 --> 00:02:48,840
It was such a coincidence.

38
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:51,840
The first scheme was used on Sun Yao.

39
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:53,919
It was just that coincidental.

40
00:02:54,240 --> 00:02:56,520
Her mother lost her phone,

41
00:02:56,719 --> 00:02:59,319
and her brother took a trip without his.

42
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:00,479
Oh, right.

43
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:03,120
If you were her fiancé,

44
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:05,879
what were you doing back then?

45
00:03:06,759 --> 00:03:08,039
What were you doing?

46
00:03:20,879 --> 00:03:22,520
By pure coincidence,

47
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:24,520
it was just perfectly timed.

48
00:03:25,960 --> 00:03:28,439
Sun Yao could not reach anyone.

49
00:03:29,479 --> 00:03:32,240
I sent her the doctored photo.

50
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:35,240
She saw her mother's blood-covered face,

51
00:03:35,319 --> 00:03:36,840
and broke down on the spot.

52
00:03:36,879 --> 00:03:39,120
Begging me to let her mother go.

53
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:40,599
So pathetic, do you not think?

54
00:03:43,080 --> 00:03:43,879
Well?

55
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:45,520
Does it sound

56
00:03:45,879 --> 00:03:48,960
like a familiar story?

57
00:03:49,759 --> 00:03:51,840
I am a very kind-hearted person.

58
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:52,960
I will not keep you in suspense.

59
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:56,599
I will tell you the rest of the story.

60
00:03:58,240 --> 00:03:59,759
If you do not want your mother to die,

61
00:03:59,759 --> 00:04:01,080
do exactly as I say.

62
00:04:01,360 --> 00:04:03,639
Okay, I'll do whatever you say.

63
00:04:03,719 --> 00:04:05,960
I transferred the money to you guys.

64
00:04:05,960 --> 00:04:06,960
Please don't hurt my mom.

65
00:04:07,159 --> 00:04:08,680
I have sent a location to your phone.

66
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:10,360
Go there now to pick her up.

67
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:12,560
Call police, and we will kill the hostage.

68
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:13,439
Okay.

69
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:24,920
Who are you?

70
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:26,639
Where's my mom?

71
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:28,560
What did you do to her?

72
00:04:35,839 --> 00:04:36,639
Do not be afraid.

73
00:04:37,639 --> 00:04:39,079
Your mother is fine.

74
00:04:45,759 --> 00:04:46,639
As long as you do as I say,

75
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:49,120
she will be okay.

76
00:04:51,800 --> 00:04:52,680
Put the mask on.

77
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:56,120
Change into these clothes.

78
00:04:58,759 --> 00:04:59,600
Go.

79
00:05:01,600 --> 00:05:02,839
I won't do it.

80
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:07,480
I knew it.

81
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:08,639
You would not listen to me.

82
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:14,040
I treat you so well.

83
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:16,279
Why can you not see my true feelings?

84
00:05:17,199 --> 00:05:18,439
What do you want?

85
00:05:21,040 --> 00:05:22,319
I will not force you.

86
00:05:25,839 --> 00:05:27,439
Just behave and cooperate.

87
00:05:27,879 --> 00:05:28,839
Do not push me.

88
00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:31,279
I'm begging you.

89
00:05:32,279 --> 00:05:33,839
I gave you the money.

90
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:35,959
I'm getting married soon.

91
00:05:36,279 --> 00:05:38,439
Please let me go.

92
00:05:38,439 --> 00:05:39,639
Please!

93
00:05:39,639 --> 00:05:40,439
Getting married?

94
00:05:40,759 --> 00:05:42,000
That makes me even more excited.

95
00:05:42,279 --> 00:05:43,240
You are marrying me.

96
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:44,959
Let me go! Let me go!

97
00:05:48,279 --> 00:05:50,720
Why... why is it you?

98
00:05:58,240 --> 00:05:59,439
Don't touch my woman!

99
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:15,279
Do not be afraid.

100
00:06:16,040 --> 00:06:17,480
Stay back!

101
00:06:17,759 --> 00:06:18,639
If you come any closer, I'll jump!

102
00:06:18,639 --> 00:06:19,519
Careful.

103
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:21,160
You are not going to jump.

104
00:06:21,519 --> 00:06:22,879
Do you not like me?

105
00:06:23,759 --> 00:06:25,560
Who would like a psycho?!

106
00:06:25,839 --> 00:06:26,720
You do not like me.

107
00:06:26,959 --> 00:06:27,959
You do not like me.

108
00:06:28,160 --> 00:06:29,519
You flirted with me first.

109
00:06:30,519 --> 00:06:31,720
That day,

110
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:33,000
you secretly took photos of me

111
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:34,279
and called me handsome.

112
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:36,319
But when I came to you,

113
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:37,800
you ignored me.

114
00:06:38,279 --> 00:06:39,279
I want to ask you.

115
00:06:39,639 --> 00:06:41,319
You call me a psycho.

116
00:06:41,720 --> 00:06:43,120
Are you the psycho, or am I?

117
00:06:44,519 --> 00:06:46,480
Answer me.

118
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:49,480
I'll die before a psycho like you wins!

119
00:06:51,959 --> 00:06:52,879
No!

120
00:07:15,319 --> 00:07:16,480
Clean up the scene.

121
00:07:18,160 --> 00:07:20,000
Do not let the police find any clues.

122
00:07:21,319 --> 00:07:21,920
Yes, sir.

123
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:25,519
What a pity.

124
00:07:31,959 --> 00:07:32,879
Bastard!

125
00:07:33,240 --> 00:07:35,040
If you don't kill me, I'll kill you!

126
00:07:36,959 --> 00:07:38,240
Kill me, huh?

127
00:07:38,240 --> 00:07:39,120
Keep dreaming.

128
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:41,120
How will you kill me?

129
00:07:41,720 --> 00:07:43,480
With your eyes?

130
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:44,639
Let me tell you,

131
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:46,439
I am leaving the country soon.

132
00:07:46,519 --> 00:07:47,920
As if you could.

133
00:07:52,879 --> 00:07:53,839
Take a look.

134
00:07:54,079 --> 00:07:55,079
Does she not look like Sun Yao?

135
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:59,040
Heaven has been too good to me.

136
00:07:59,319 --> 00:08:00,399
Actually, I think

137
00:08:00,399 --> 00:08:02,560
it is a real pity that Sun Yao died.

138
00:08:03,319 --> 00:08:05,639
But Heaven gifted me another one,

139
00:08:05,879 --> 00:08:07,839
a woman who looks exactly like her.

140
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:10,920
What do you think? Do they look alike?

141
00:08:12,240 --> 00:08:13,680
Well, do they?

142
00:08:13,759 --> 00:08:14,519
Do they?

143
00:08:16,600 --> 00:08:17,720
What are you going to do to her?

144
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:21,360
Of course, before I leave,

145
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:24,319
I will make her completely mine.

146
00:08:27,319 --> 00:08:29,839
But do not worry.

147
00:08:30,480 --> 00:08:31,560
Before you die,

148
00:08:32,480 --> 00:08:34,720
I will let you take one last look at her.

149
00:08:37,879 --> 00:08:38,679
Look!

150
00:08:42,159 --> 00:08:42,960
Beat him.

151
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:46,279
Feel free to get creative.

152
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:51,279
Just do not kill him.

153
00:08:52,320 --> 00:08:53,120
Yes, sir.

154
00:09:22,240 --> 00:09:23,960
Gu Ting, please do not worry.

155
00:09:24,559 --> 00:09:25,919
We are doing all we can to find him.

156
00:09:26,600 --> 00:09:27,240
Captain Sun.

157
00:09:28,440 --> 00:09:30,399
At the hospital, you called me Yao Yao.

158
00:09:31,480 --> 00:09:32,519
Who is Yao Yao?

159
00:09:43,039 --> 00:09:45,559
This is my sister, Sun Yao.

160
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:47,720
She was also Li Wen's fiancée.

161
00:09:48,639 --> 00:09:49,679
Two years ago,

162
00:09:50,120 --> 00:09:52,000
Yao Yao fell victim to a scam syndicate

163
00:09:52,519 --> 00:09:53,480
and passed away.

164
00:09:55,879 --> 00:09:56,759
So,

165
00:09:59,360 --> 00:10:00,559
Li Wen approached me

166
00:10:01,840 --> 00:10:03,600
because I look like Sun Yao,

167
00:10:04,759 --> 00:10:07,840
and my father might be a fraud suspect.

168
00:10:08,360 --> 00:10:09,240
At first,

169
00:10:10,039 --> 00:10:11,279
Li Wen just wanted Gu Yan

170
00:10:11,639 --> 00:10:13,039
to help him infiltrate the scam syndicate.

171
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:16,559
But he did not know you looked so alike.

172
00:10:16,879 --> 00:10:18,320
So I am not anyone's stand-in.

173
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:20,879
And I am not some bait.

174
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:24,159
I am Gu Ting.

175
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:30,000
The person I want to save

176
00:10:31,399 --> 00:10:33,840
is the man who clearly hates my father,

177
00:10:34,399 --> 00:10:36,240
yet still risked his life to save me.

178
00:11:38,919 --> 00:11:40,720
Yaoyao...

179
00:11:42,360 --> 00:11:43,639
How could you...

180
00:11:51,919 --> 00:11:53,720
How could you be so foolish?

181
00:12:33,879 --> 00:12:34,679
Yaoyao.

182
00:12:36,799 --> 00:12:38,840
I promise I will bring Li Wen back safely.

183
00:12:41,759 --> 00:12:44,240
I haven't reached Li Wen for days.

184
00:12:44,639 --> 00:12:46,879
Could something have happened to him?

185
00:12:47,279 --> 00:12:50,039
Did he go after Yan for revenge?

186
00:12:51,840 --> 00:12:54,559
Right. I have the private line he left me.

187
00:13:12,120 --> 00:13:13,039
Gu Ting.

188
00:13:13,720 --> 00:13:14,759
Do you need something?

189
00:13:14,960 --> 00:13:15,639
Hello?

190
00:13:17,200 --> 00:13:18,279
Mr. Yan.

191
00:13:19,639 --> 00:13:21,240
I really don't know what to do.

192
00:13:21,240 --> 00:13:22,759
That's why I called you.

193
00:13:23,480 --> 00:13:24,279
Calm down.

194
00:13:24,960 --> 00:13:25,759
By the way,

195
00:13:26,559 --> 00:13:28,399
how did you get my number?

196
00:13:28,799 --> 00:13:30,559
You gave it to me before.

197
00:13:30,559 --> 00:13:32,399
You said it was my private line.

198
00:13:33,360 --> 00:13:34,240
Mr. Yan,

199
00:13:34,440 --> 00:13:36,360
my dad is really a scammer.

200
00:13:36,600 --> 00:13:39,360
I handed the evidence to the police.

201
00:13:39,759 --> 00:13:42,000
That is putting justice before family.

202
00:13:44,159 --> 00:13:46,039
I really don't know what to do anymore.

203
00:13:46,360 --> 00:13:49,039
My boyfriend broke up with me over this.

204
00:13:49,840 --> 00:13:52,399
Strangers kidnapped me all day yesterday.

205
00:13:53,840 --> 00:13:55,720
I feel like I can't go on anymore.

206
00:13:56,519 --> 00:13:57,720
Do not do anything rash.

207
00:13:58,360 --> 00:13:59,399
You only have one life.

208
00:14:00,320 --> 00:14:01,200
Do not do anything foolish.

209
00:14:02,039 --> 00:14:04,720
Mr. Yan, the school said you took leave.

210
00:14:05,440 --> 00:14:06,639
Where are you?

211
00:14:06,799 --> 00:14:08,720
You're the only one I can rely on now.

212
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:11,399
I am recovering in a remote place.

213
00:14:12,759 --> 00:14:14,559
I will send a car to pick you up.

214
00:14:14,799 --> 00:14:15,879
Thank you, Mr. Yan.

215
00:14:16,039 --> 00:14:17,120
You're so kind.

216
00:14:17,559 --> 00:14:18,320
Wait for me.

217
00:14:18,879 --> 00:14:19,679
Okay.
